  "description": "High-throughput, low-allocation, fuzz-resistant DICOM toolkit for .NET: Part 10 parsing that never throws on bad data, multi-gigabyte files with lazy pixel data, async DIMSE networking on System.IO.Pipelines (C-ECHO, C-STORE, C-FIND, Modality Worklist, C-MOVE and C-GET, SCU and SCP), PDF and JPEG/PNG/BMP to DICOM conversion, parallel batch processing, attribute mapping, PS3.15-style anonymization and channel-routed audit logging. Companion packages: Plgic.Dicom.Imaging, Plgic.Dicom.Web and Plgic.Dicom.Web.AspNetCore. Free for evaluation, non-commercial use and small companies (under USD 1M annual revenue); commercial production use by larger organisations needs a paid license. No license key required today.",
